Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean-17-Some results about products and sums over the type `Fin`.
Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean-18-
Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean:19:The most important results are the induction formulas `Fin.prod_univ_castSucc`
Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean:20:and `Fin.prod_univ_succ`, and the formula `Fin.prod_const` for the product of a
Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean-21-constant function. These results have variants for sums instead of products.
Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean-22-
Mathlib/Algebra/BigOperators/Fin.lean-23-## Main declarations
